<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>Never more could we desire</l><l>Anything that’s less than You,</l><l>And to this we would aspire—</l><l>Simply to be filled with You.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus Lord, You’re our first love;</l><l>You’re the One we love the best.</l><l>When our heart is loving You,</l><l>How we’re filled with Your sweet rest!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
